      "id": "txt_0215",
      "reading_order": 294,
      "section": "Automatic control of the compressor operation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.11,
        "t": 172.25408590000006,
        "r": 532.9716114399986,
        "b": 135.44022159999997
      },
      "content": "A number of time-based automatic start/stop commands may be programmed. Take into account that a start command will be executed (if programmed and activated), even after manually stopping the compressor.",
